OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged over after bin set on
OL,4,Afire outside house
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged to court
OL,7,Ffollowing an arson attack in County
OL,8,FTyrone.
OL,10,FPolice attended the scene of a fire at
OL,11,Fa property in Gortgonis Terrace,
OL,12,FCoalisland, at about 23:40 BST on
OL,13,FSunday.
OL,15,FThe fire was deliberately started in a
OL,16,Fbin which had been placed by a shed at
OL,17,Fthe property, police said. Some damage
OL,18,Fwas caused to the shed door, along with
OL,19,Fsmoke damage inside the shed, however,
OL,20,Fthere was no further damage reported.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
